# What the image builds must not be given.
#
# Both Dockerfiles take the repository root as their build context, because a
# pnpm workspace install needs the lockfile and every manifest beside it. That
# makes this file the thing keeping the context honest.

# Installed for whichever machine ran `pnpm install`. A Linux image resolves its
# own, and copying these in would hand it a macOS esbuild.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Rebuilt inside the image. A stale local copy would otherwise be the one that
# ships.
**/dist
**/.nuxt
**/.output
*.tgz

# The marker the web test module writes, which changes what a build produces.
packages/web/.nuxtrc

# History, prose, CI and test artefacts: nothing either build reads.
.git
.github
.navbook
doc
test
packages/web/test-results
packages/web/playwright-report

# Never. This is the file that holds the token.
.env
